#! rate=48000 block=64 tracks=2
# External clock (engine.rs 1805-1958): FA anchoring bar 0 while playing,
# follow at 125 BPM (F8 every 960 frames, 24 PPQN), the EMA through a
# slow-down (1024) and a speed-up (960, 896, 960), FA again (both transports
# restart on the bar), then FC: the internal clock resumes at Move's tempo and
# Start is re-sent on our next bar. `link` stays 0, so FA and FC do not
# start or stop our transport. Every F8 lands on a block start (64 frames).
# Track 1's notes last 300 ticks, so each FA finds notes sounding to flush.
# D1 trace: each tick at the frame where Movy, fed one frame at a time, fires it
@0 tog 0 0 60 100
@0 tog 0 4 62 100
@0 tog 0 8 64 100
@0 tog 0 12 65 100
@0 tog 1 0 36 100
@0 tog 1 6 38 100
@0 tog 1 10 42 90
@0 slen 1 0 15 -1 300
@0 metro 1
@0 play
@9600 rt F8
@10560 rt F8
@11520 rt F8
@12480 rt FA
